	Fiona: You don't know how much this means to me!
	Fiona: Oh, sorry! You have a lot of work to do!
- Yeah...
	Fiona: ...
	Fiona: Oh, sorry... You have a lot of work to do!
- You can watch if you want
	Fiona: I can?
	- Of course
	Fiona: Yeaaah!
	Fiona: But my mom said I shouldn't go too far, I'll watch you from a distance.
Fiona: I don't want to be a burden
if GlobalVars.tower_amount == GlobalVars.tower_completed:
